2026-11-10  ebeem  <lord.ebeem@gmail.com>
	Version 0.0.5 released.

	* gleui/toast: Add #:eat-next-key? key to emit toast on next key
	press.
	* commands/help: Add describe-top-map command to show the
	keybindings available under the top-map.
	* contrib/keybindings: Add the keybindings s-SPC h ? to show the
	top-map keybindings.
	* gleui/palette: Fix a problem where the last focused window isn't
	automatically focused after the palette is closed.
	* river/viewporter-manager: Implement Wayland viewporter protocol
	to support fractional scaling.
	* commands/shell: Fix gliver-quit command and introduce config
	parameter *quit-exits-river* to exit only Gliver or river completly.
